>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            numbers[j], numbers[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numbers[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], numbers[j]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"排序结果：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, numbers)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>冒泡排序的过程就像水中的气泡——较大的数字会像气泡一样逐渐&quot;浮&quot;到数列的末尾。每一轮比较后，当前最大的未排序数字都会到达正确位置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法效率初探\">算法效率初探</h3><p>同一个问题可能有多种不同的解法，那么如何评价哪种算法更好呢？最直观的标准就是看算法执行的步骤数量。</p>\n<p>以查找为例，假设有 100 个数据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>最好情况</th>\n<th>最坏情况</th>\n<th>平均情况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顺序查找</td>\n<td>1 次比较</td>\n<td>100 次比较</td>\n<td>50 次比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二分查找（数据已排序）</td>\n<td>1 次比较</td>\n<td>7 次比较</td>\n<td>约 6 次比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>二分查找的思想类似于猜数字游戏中的&quot;折半&quot;策略——每次都猜中间值，根据大小提示排除一半的可能性。这种方法效率远高于逐个查找，但要求数据必须事先排好顺序。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"numbers = [11, 12, 22, 25, 34, 64, 78, 85, 90, 95]&#10;target = 78&#10;low = 0&#10;high = len(numbers) - 1&#10;steps = 0&#10;&#10;while low &lt;= high:&#10;    mid = (low + high) // 2&#10;    steps = steps + 1&#10;    if numbers[mid] == target:&#10;        print(f&quot;找到 {target}，位置为第 {mid + 1} 个，用了 {steps} 步&quot;)&#10;        break&#10;    elif numbers[mid] &lt; target:&#10;        low = mid + 1&#10;    else:&#10;        high = mid - 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">11</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">34</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 78</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">low </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span sty